 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2022-12-15",
   "text": "Fair Elections Now Act of 2022\n This bill establishes the Freedom from Influence Fund, which shall provide funding to Senate candidates who meet specified conditions and agree to abide by certain requirements, such as limits on types of campaign funding sources. The bill also imposes a tax on certain U.S. government contracts."
  }
